---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
import SiteHeader from "../../components/SiteHeader.astro";
import SiteFooter from "../../components/SiteFooter.astro";
import { locations, navItems } from "../../data/site";
---

<Layout
	title="Finding Calm in the Chaos · Free Guide for Teachers · Awaken Discovery"
	description="A free guide for overwhelmed teachers — gentle, body-aware tools to ground yourself in under 60 seconds when you're already running on empty."
>
	<SiteHeader navItems={navItems} />
	<main class="sales-page">
		<!-- ============== HERO ============== -->
		<section class="sl-hero">
			<div class="container sl-hero-inner">
				<div class="sl-hero-copy">
					<p class="sl-pre">Listen…</p>
					<h1>
						If You're Lying Awake at 3 AM Dreading Monday Morning… Crying in Your Car
						Before You Walk Into School… or Fantasising About Quitting Teaching But
						Terrified You Can't Afford To…
					</h1>
					<p class="sl-promise">
						Then My Free Guide Will Show You How to Survive the Rest of This Term
						Without Completely Falling Apart.
					</p>
					<a class="cta cta-solid sl-cta-primary" href="#claim">
						Yes — Send Me the Free Guide
					</a>
				</div>
				<figure class="sl-hero-figure">
					<img
						src="/assets/images/finding-calm-hero-ally.png"
						alt="Ally — ex-teacher, counsellor and psychotherapist — sitting calmly at her desk"
						loading="eager"
						decoding="async"
						fetchpriority="high"
					/>
					<figcaption class="sl-image-todo">
						{`{{IMAGE PROMPT: Warm, candid portrait of Ally — ex-teacher, now counsellor — sitting in a calm sage-toned therapy room. Soft natural light, a warm mug nearby, gentle eye contact, hint of a smile. Should feel safe and like a friend, not clinical.}}`}
					</figcaption>
				</figure>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- ============== TRUTH ============== -->
		<section class="sl-band">
			<div class="container sl-prose">
				<p class="sl-lead">
					Here's the truth nobody in the staffroom is saying out loud:
				</p>
				<p>
					You're not "not cut out for this." You're not weak. And you're definitely
					not the only one feeling this way.
				</p>
				<p>
					What you <em>are</em> is carrying an impossible load that gets heavier every
					single term… and your nervous system is screaming for relief.
				</p>
				<p class="sl-stack">
					The Sunday night dread.<br />
					The panic attacks in the stationery cupboard.<br />
					The constant feeling that you're failing everyone — your students, your
					colleagues, the parents, yourself.
				</p>
				<p class="sl-pull">Sound familiar?</p>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- ============== STAFFROOM IMAGE ============== -->
		<section class="sl-image-band">
			<div class="container">
				<figure>
					<img
						src="/assets/images/staff-room-truth-section.png"
						alt="A quiet moment alone in an empty staffroom"
						loading="lazy"
						decoding="async"
					/>
					<figcaption class="sl-image-todo">
						{`{{IMAGE PROMPT: A teacher alone in a quiet moment — empty staffroom or empty classroom after hours, low warm light, a half-drunk mug of tea, exercise books closed on the desk. Should evoke "the end of a long day" not despair.}}`}
					</figcaption>
				</figure>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- ============== DIFFERENCE ============== -->
		<section class="sl-band sl-band-soft">
			<div class="container sl-prose">
				<h2>What Makes This Different From Every Other "Teacher Wellbeing" Initiative</h2>
				<p>
					Most wellbeing programs tell you to "practice self-care." To do yoga. To
					set boundaries. To "just say no."
				</p>
				<p class="sl-emphasis">
					I'm going to show you how to actually <em>survive</em> the day when
					you're already running on empty.
				</p>
				<p>Because here's what I discovered after leaving teaching myself:</p>
				<blockquote class="sl-quote">
					The anxiety you're feeling isn't because you're doing something wrong. It's
					because your body is trying to protect you from a system that's broken.
				</blockquote>
				<p>
					And until you learn to work <em>with</em> your nervous system instead of
					pushing through and ignoring it… no amount of bubble baths or mindfulness
					apps will give you lasting relief.
				</p>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- ============== STORY ============== -->
		<section class="sl-band">
			<div class="container sl-prose sl-story">
				<h2>I Know This Because I Lived It</h2>
				<p>I was you.</p>
				<p>
					The exhausted teacher who loved the kids but couldn't take one more data
					meeting, one more observation, one more initiative that added to the
					workload without taking anything away.
				</p>
				<p>I left teaching because it was literally destroying my health.</p>
				<p>
					And in the years since, I've become a Counsellor and Psychotherapist
					specialising in anxiety… and I've worked with dozens of teachers just like
					you.
				</p>
				<ul class="sl-bullets">
					<li>Teachers who are desperately trying to hold it together.</li>
					<li>
						Teachers who feel guilty for struggling when they "should" be grateful to
						have a job.
					</li>
					<li>
						Teachers who are terrified they're going to have a breakdown in front of
						their Year 9s.
					</li>
				</ul>
				<p>That's why I created this free guide specifically for teachers.</p>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- ============== GUIDE OFFER ============== -->
		<section class="sl-offer" id="offer">
			<div class="container sl-offer-grid">
				<figure class="sl-offer-mockup">
					<img
						src="/assets/images/teachers-guide-hero.svg"
						alt="Mockup of the Finding Calm in the Chaos guide for teachers"
						loading="lazy"
						decoding="async"
					/>
					<figcaption class="sl-image-todo">
						{`{{IMAGE PROMPT: 3D mockup or flatlay of the "Finding Calm in the Chaos" PDF guide — sage-green cover with calligraphic title, gentle leaf motif, shown on a softly lit desk next to a notebook and a warm mug. Cosy, not corporate.}}`}
					</figcaption>
				</figure>
				<div class="sl-offer-copy">
					<p class="sl-eyebrow">Grab Your Free Guide</p>
					<h2>Finding Calm in the Chaos</h2>
					<p class="sl-sub">
						A Teacher's Guide to Grounding Yourself When You're Already Overwhelmed
					</p>
					<p>Inside, you'll discover:</p>
					<ul class="sl-inside">
						<li>
							<strong>How to gently ground yourself in under 60 seconds</strong> —
							even between lessons when you've got 47 exercise books to mark and a
							parent email that's making your stomach churn.
						</li>
						<li>
							<strong>Simple body-aware techniques</strong> you can use in the
							classroom, the staffroom or your car without anyone noticing.
						</li>
						<li>
							<strong>Why your anxiety gets WORSE during the school holidays</strong>
							— and what to do about it.
						</li>
						<li>
							<strong>A gentle reflection space</strong> to notice what's actually
							happening in your body when the pressure builds — so you can spot the
							warning signs before you hit complete burnout.
						</li>
						<li>
							<strong>Personal "anchors"</strong> you can return to when you're in
							the middle of a challenging lesson, a difficult conversation, or
							another pointless meeting that could have been an email.
						</li>
					</ul>
					<p class="sl-promise-small">
						This isn't about "fixing" you or making you a "better teacher." This is
						about helping you survive the system without sacrificing your mental
						health.
					</p>
					<a class="cta cta-solid sl-cta-primary" href="#claim">
						Yes — Send Me the Free Guide
					</a>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- ============== AUTHORITY ============== -->
		<section class="sl-band sl-band-soft">
			<div class="container sl-authority">
				<figure class="sl-authority-photo">
					<img
						src="/assets/images/teachers-guide-ally.svg"
						alt="Ally — counsellor, psychotherapist and ex-teacher"
						loading="lazy"
						decoding="async"
					/>
					<figcaption class="sl-image-todo">
						{`{{IMAGE PROMPT: Second portrait of Ally — slightly more "professional" feel than the hero shot. Sitting in her Market Weighton therapy room, plants and books in soft focus behind. Calm, warm, trustworthy.}}`}
					</figcaption>
				</figure>
				<div class="sl-authority-copy">
					<h2>Who Am I and Why Should You Listen?</h2>
					<p>I'm Ally, and I'm a Counsellor, Psychotherapist and wellbeing educator.</p>
					<p class="sl-emphasis">But more importantly? I'm an ex-teacher who gets it.</p>
					<ul class="sl-bullets">
						<li>I know what it's like to spend your lunch break photocopying instead of eating.</li>
						<li>I know what it's like to work until 9 PM and still feel like you haven't done enough.</li>
						<li>I know what it's like to love teaching but hate what it's doing to your body and mind.</li>
					</ul>
					<p>
						I left the profession because the pressure and burnout was exhausting me.
						Probably killing me, to be honest.
					</p>
					<p>
						And now I help teachers like you understand your anxiety and find ways to
						cope with the impossible demands… without leaving the profession (unless
						that's what you want to do).
					</p>
					<p>
						I work with individuals online, by telephone and face-to-face from my
						peaceful therapy rooms in Market Weighton, East Yorkshire, England.
					</p>
					<p>
						I've developed a gentle, body-aware approach that actually works when
						you're already running on empty and don't have time for complicated
						self-care routines.
					</p>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- ============== NEXT STEPS ============== -->
		<section class="sl-band">
			<div class="container sl-prose">
				<h2>Here's What Happens Next</h2>
				<ol class="sl-steps">
					<li>
						<span class="sl-step-num">01</span>
						<div>
							<h3>Enter your email below</h3>
							<p>And grab your free guide.</p>
						</div>
					</li>
					<li>
						<span class="sl-step-num">02</span>
						<div>
							<h3>Try the techniques during your next difficult day</h3>
							<p>They take less than 60 seconds each.</p>
						</div>
					</li>
					<li>
						<span class="sl-step-num">03</span>
						<div>
							<h3>Notice what feels different</h3>
							<p>
								When you're not constantly fighting your own nervous system.
							</p>
						</div>
					</li>
				</ol>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- ============== CLAIM / FORM ============== -->
		<section class="sl-claim" id="claim">
			<div class="container sl-claim-inner">
				<div class="sl-claim-copy">
					<p class="sl-eyebrow">Yes — Send Me the Free Guide</p>
					<h2>Finding Calm in the Chaos</h2>
					<p>
						Pop your email below and the guide will land in your inbox in the next
						few minutes.
					</p>
				</div>
				<form
					class="sl-form"
					method="post"
					action="#"
					aria-describedby="sl-form-todo"
					novalidate
				>
					<label class="sl-field">
						<span>Your email</span>
						<input
							type="email"
							name="email"
							autocomplete="email"
							required
							placeholder="you@school.com"
						/>
					</label>
					<label class="sl-consent">
						<input type="checkbox" name="consent" required />
						<span>
							Please send me the guide and supportive wellbeing emails. I can
							unsubscribe at any time.
						</span>
					</label>
					<button class="cta cta-solid sl-submit" type="submit">
						Yes — Send Me the Free Guide Now
					</button>
					<p class="sl-privacy">
						We handle your details with care. See our
						<a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>.
					</p>
					<p id="sl-form-todo" class="sl-image-todo">
						{`{{TODO: connect form to ESP — on submit, send PDF + trigger nurture sequence, then redirect to /finding-calm-teachers/thank-you}}`}
					</p>
				</form>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- ============== CLOSING ============== -->
		<section class="sl-band sl-closing">
			<div class="container sl-prose">
				<p class="sl-stack sl-big">
					You don't need to keep white-knuckling your way through every term.<br />
					You don't need to wait until half-term to breathe again.<br />
					You don't need to choose between your career and your sanity.
				</p>
				<p>Download the guide. Give yourself this moment.</p>
				<p class="sl-emphasis">
					You deserve to feel calm again… even in the middle of the chaos.
				</p>
				<p class="sl-signoff">— Ally</p>
				<aside class="sl-ps">
					<p>
						<strong>P.S.</strong> You became a teacher because you wanted to make a
						difference. But you can't pour from an empty cup. Let me help you find
						your way back to yourself… so you can keep doing the work you love
						without it destroying you.
					</p>
					<a class="cta cta-outline" href="#claim">Send Me the Free Guide</a>
				</aside>
			</div>
		</section>
	</main>
	<SiteFooter
		navItems={navItems}
		locations={locations}
		tagline="Helping overwhelmed teachers reconnect with themselves beyond survival mode."
	/>
</Layout>

<style>
	.sales-page {
		--ink: var(--color-dark-gray);
		--brand: var(--color-dark-slate-gray);
		--brand-deep: #004836;
		--cream: #fbf9f5;
		--cream-deep: #f3eee5;
		font-size: 1.05rem;
		line-height: 1.75;
		color: var(--ink);
		background: var(--cream);
	}

	.sales-page :global(.cta) {
		font-size: 1rem;
		padding: 0.9rem 1.4rem;
	}

	.sl-cta-primary {
		background: var(--brand);
		color: var(--color-white);
		border: 1px solid var(--brand);
		box-shadow: 0 8px 22px rgb(0 94 71 / 22%);
	}

	.sl-cta-primary:hover,
	.sl-cta-primary:focus-visible {
		background: var(--brand-deep);
		border-color: var(--brand-deep);
	}

	/* HERO */
	.sl-hero {
		padding-block: clamp(3rem, 8vh, 6rem);
		background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--cream) 0%, var(--cream-deep) 100%);
	}

	.sl-hero-inner {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 1.15fr 0.85fr;
		gap: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 4rem);
		align-items: center;
	}

	.sl-pre {
		margin: 0;
		font-family: var(--font-script);
		font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem);
		color: var(--brand);
		line-height: 1;
	}

	.sl-hero h1 {
		margin: 0.6rem 0 1rem;
		font-family: var(--font-serif);
		font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 3.8vw, 2.7rem);
		font-weight: 500;
		line-height: 1.18;
		text-wrap: balance;
	}

	.sl-promise {
		margin: 0 0 1.6rem;
		font-family: var(--font-serif);
		font-style: italic;
		font-size: clamp(1.1rem, 2vw, 1.4rem);
		color: var(--brand-deep);
		max-width: 60ch;
	}

	.sl-hero-figure {
		margin: 0;
	}

	.sl-hero-figure img {
		width: 100%;
		aspect-ratio: 4 / 5;
		object-fit: cover;
		object-position: 50% 30%;
		border-radius: 1rem;
		box-shadow: 0 18px 40px rgb(29 35 39 / 16%);
	}

	/* BANDS */
	.sl-band {
		padding-block: clamp(3rem, 7vh, 5rem);
	}

	.sl-band-soft {
		background: var(--cream-deep);
	}

	.sl-prose {
		max-width: 64ch;
	}

	.sl-prose h2 {
		margin: 0 0 1.1rem;
		font-family: var(--font-serif);
		font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 3vw, 2.2rem);
		font-weight: 500;
		line-height: 1.2;
		text-wrap: balance;
	}

	.sl-prose p {
		margin: 0 0 1.1rem;
	}

	.sl-lead {
		font-family: var(--font-serif);
		font-size: 1.25rem;
		font-style: italic;
		color: var(--brand-deep);
	}

	.sl-stack {
		line-height: 1.9;
	}

	.sl-big {
		font-size: 1.15rem;
	}

	.sl-pull {
		font-family: var(--font-serif);
		font-style: italic;
		font-size: 1.4rem;
		color: var(--brand);
	}

	.sl-emphasis {
		font-weight: 500;
		font-size: 1.1rem;
	}

	.sl-quote {
		margin: 1.5rem 0;
		padding: 1.2rem 1.4rem;
		border-left: 3px solid var(--brand);
		background: rgb(0 94 71 / 6%);
		font-family: var(--font-serif);
		font-style: italic;
		font-size: 1.15rem;
		line-height: 1.55;
		color: var(--brand-deep);
		border-radius: 0 0.6rem 0.6rem 0;
	}

	.sl-bullets {
		margin: 0 0 1.1rem;
		padding-left: 1.2rem;
		display: grid;
		gap: 0.55rem;
	}

	.sl-bullets li {
		line-height: 1.7;
	}

	/* IMAGE BAND */
	.sl-image-band {
		padding-block: 1.5rem;
		background: var(--cream);
	}

	.sl-image-band img {
		width: 100%;
		max-height: 420px;
		object-fit: cover;
		border-radius: 1rem;
		box-shadow: 0 14px 30px rgb(29 35 39 / 12%);
	}

	.sl-image-band figcaption,
	.sl-hero-figure figcaption {
		margin-top: 0.45rem;
	}

	.sl-image-todo {
		font-size: 0.72rem;
		font-style: italic;
		opacity: 0.55;
		text-align: left;
		line-height: 1.5;
	}

	/* OFFER */
	.sl-offer {
		padding-block: clamp(3rem, 7vh, 5rem);
		background: linear-gradient(160deg, #eaf0ea 0%, var(--cream-deep) 100%);
	}

	.sl-offer-grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 0.85fr 1.15fr;
		gap: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 4rem);
		align-items: center;
	}

	.sl-offer-mockup img {
		width: 100%;
		max-width: 360px;
		margin-inline: auto;
		filter: drop-shadow(0 18px 36px rgb(0 94 71 / 18%));
	}

	.sl-eyebrow {
		margin: 0;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		letter-spacing: 0.1em;
		font-size: 0.78rem;
		font-weight: 600;
		color: var(--brand);
	}

	.sl-offer-copy h2 {
		margin: 0.6rem 0 0.3rem;
		font-family: var(--font-serif);
		font-size: clamp(1.7rem, 3.3vw, 2.4rem);
		font-weight: 500;
	}

	.sl-sub {
		margin: 0 0 1.2rem;
		font-family: var(--font-serif);
		font-style: italic;
		color: var(--brand-deep);
		font-size: 1.1rem;
	}

	.sl-inside {
		list-style: none;
		padding: 0;
		margin: 0 0 1.4rem;
		display: grid;
		gap: 0.9rem;
	}

	.sl-inside li {
		position: relative;
		padding-left: 2rem;
		line-height: 1.65;
	}

	.sl-inside li::before {
		content: "✓";
		position: absolute;
		left: 0;
		top: 0;
		width: 1.4rem;
		height: 1.4rem;
		display: inline-flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
		border-radius: 999px;
		background: var(--brand);
		color: var(--color-white);
		font-size: 0.8rem;
		font-weight: 700;
	}

	.sl-promise-small {
		font-style: italic;
		color: var(--brand-deep);
		margin-bottom: 1.4rem;
	}

	/* AUTHORITY */
	.sl-authority {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 0.85fr 1.15fr;
		gap: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 4rem);
		align-items: center;
	}

	.sl-authority-photo img {
		width: 100%;
		aspect-ratio: 4 / 5;
		object-fit: cover;
		border-radius: 1rem;
		box-shadow: 0 16px 32px rgb(29 35 39 / 14%);
	}

	.sl-authority-copy h2 {
		margin: 0 0 1rem;
		font-family: var(--font-serif);
		font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 3vw, 2.2rem);
		font-weight: 500;
	}

	.sl-authority-copy p {
		margin: 0 0 1rem;
		max-width: 60ch;
	}

	/* STEPS */
	.sl-steps {
		list-style: none;
		padding: 0;
		margin: 1rem 0 0;
		display: grid;
		gap: 1rem;
	}

	.sl-steps li {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: auto 1fr;
		gap: 1.1rem;
		align-items: start;
		padding: 1.1rem 1.2rem;
		background: var(--color-white);
		border: 1px solid rgb(0 94 71 / 16%);
		border-radius: 0.85rem;
	}

	.sl-step-num {
		font-family: var(--font-serif);
		font-size: 1.6rem;
		color: var(--brand);
		font-weight: 500;
		line-height: 1;
	}

	.sl-steps h3 {
		margin: 0 0 0.2rem;
		font-family: var(--font-serif);
		font-size: 1.2rem;
		font-weight: 500;
	}

	.sl-steps p {
		margin: 0;
		font-size: 0.95rem;
		opacity: 0.85;
	}

	/* CLAIM FORM */
	.sl-claim {
		padding-block: clamp(3rem, 7vh, 5rem);
		background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--cream-deep) 0%, #eaf0ea 100%);
	}

	.sl-claim-inner {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
		gap: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3.5rem);
		align-items: center;
	}

	.sl-claim-copy h2 {
		margin: 0.4rem 0 0.8rem;
		font-family: var(--font-serif);
		font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 3.5vw, 2.5rem);
		font-weight: 500;
	}

	.sl-form {
		background: var(--color-white);
		padding: 1.8rem 1.6rem;
		border-radius: 1rem;
		border: 1px solid rgb(0 94 71 / 18%);
		box-shadow: 0 12px 28px rgb(29 35 39 / 10%);
		display: grid;
		gap: 1rem;
	}

	.sl-field {
		display: grid;
		gap: 0.35rem;
		font-size: 0.85rem;
	}

	.sl-field input {
		padding: 0.8rem 1rem;
		border-radius: 0.6rem;
		border: 1px solid var(--color-gainsboro);
		font: inherit;
	}

	.sl-field input:focus-visible {
		outline: none;
		border-color: var(--brand);
